= Ekaterina Breshko-Breshkovskaya

Breshko-Breshkovskaya (1844-1934), the 'grandmother of the revolution', has spent thirty years in prison and exile. She is a Right SR, and the party's greatest symbol.

- @action
- @root: Return to main

